What this repository changes
----------------------------
Nothing yet: src/ is still to be written as the stripped copy. When it is, the
patch set is exactly `diff -u vendor/nvs.c src/nvs.c`, and it will be limited
to: replacing the kernel/device/logging dependencies with nvs_port.h, a small
CRC16, and plain error codes. No functional change to the storage algorithm.
